---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "October 16, 2026";
---

<Layout
    title="Terms of Service — ToolsVibe"
    description="Read the ToolsVibe terms of service for using our free online tools, including calculator disclaimers and usage rules."
>
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

        <section class="space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
                Welcome to ToolsVibe. By accessing or using our website, you
                agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree
                with any part of these terms, please do not use our website.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">1. Use of Our Tools</h2>
            <p>
                Our tools are provided free of charge for personal and
                commercial use. You may use them as often as you like, subject
                to these terms. You agree not to:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
                <li>Use the website for any unlawful purpose</li>
                <li>Attempt to disrupt or overload our servers</li>
                <li>
                    Copy, resell, or redistribute our tools without permission
                </li>
                <li>Use automated scripts to abuse the service</li>
            </ul>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">2. No Warranty</h2>
            <p>
                Our tools are provided "as is" and "as available" without any
                warranties of any kind, express or implied. We do not guarantee
                that the tools will be error-free, uninterrupted, or produce
                accurate results in every situation.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                3. Calculators and Estimates
            </h2>
            <p>
                ToolsVibe provides a variety of calculators and estimation
                tools, including but not limited to salary tax calculators,
                freelancer tax calculators, Zakat calculators, EMI calculators,
                and financial calculators.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
                <strong
                    >All calculators on ToolsVibe are for estimation and
                    informational purposes only.</strong
                >
                They do not constitute tax, legal, financial, or religious advice.
                Results are based on publicly available data, current tax slabs, and
                user-provided inputs.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">Actual figures may vary due to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-2">
                <li>Changes in tax laws, regulations, or rates</li>
                <li>Individual circumstances, deductions, or exemptions</li>
                <li>Bank-specific policies, fees, or calculation methods</li>
                <li>
                    Religious rulings that may differ by scholar or school of
                    thought
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4">
                For accurate, personalized advice, please consult a qualified
                professional (tax consultant, financial advisor, bank
                representative, or religious scholar) before making any
                financial, legal, or religious decisions.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                4. Limitation of Liability
            </h2>
            <p>
                ToolsVibe shall not be liable for any damages arising from the
                use or inability to use our website or tools, including but not
                limited to data loss, loss of profits, or business interruption.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                5. Intellectual Property
            </h2>
            <p>
                All content on ToolsVibe — including the design, code, text, and
                graphics — is the property of ToolsVibe unless otherwise stated.
                You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works
                without our written permission.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">6. User Content</h2>
            <p>
                You are solely responsible for any content you process using our
                tools. Since all processing happens in your browser, we never
                see or store your content.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                7. Third-Party Links and Ads
            </h2>
            <p>
                Our website may contain links to third-party websites and
                display third-party advertisements. We are not responsible for
                the content, privacy practices, or accuracy of any third-party
                site.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">
                8. Changes to These Terms
            </h2>
            <p>
                We may update these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will
                be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.
                Continued use of the website after changes means you accept the
                new terms.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-3">9. Contact</h2>
            <p>
                For questions about these Terms, visit our{" "}
                <a href="/contact/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline"
                    >contact page</a
                >.
            </p>
        </section>
    </article>
    <!--- Structured Data for SEO --->
    <script
        type="application/ld+json"
        set:html={JSON.stringify({
            "@context": "https://schema.org",
            "@type": "WebPage",
            name: "Terms of Service — ToolsVibe",
            url: "https://toolsvibe.online/terms/",
            description:
                "Read the ToolsVibe terms of service for using our free online tools, including calculator disclaimers and usage rules.",
            isPartOf: {
                "@type": "WebSite",
                name: "ToolsVibe",
                url: "https://toolsvibe.online/",
            },
            dateModified: "2026-10-21",
        })}
    />
</Layout>
